  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-212313",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=1$ and then evaluate the absolute value before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3-|{2}^{-x}-\\frac{5}{2}| & = \\\\ 3-|{2}^{-1}-\\frac{5}{2}| & = \\\\ 3-|\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{5}{2}| & = \\\\ 3-|-2| & = \\\\ 3-2 & = \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
